# Keeping these out is not only about image size.
#
# .env.local holds the anon key and the clinic id. Copied into a layer it stays
# in the image history even if a later step deletes it, and anyone who can pull
# the image can read it. Settings are passed at run time instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
.next
out
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

.git
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
README.md

# The portal reads the database over HTTPS; it does not run migrations or
# deploy functions, so none of this belongs in it.
supabase
